{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Length.</b> The ignorant say that the measure of 28 is on account of the 28 camps of the moon [lunar mansions]. The correct view is that the ten curtains were in the manner of “who stretches out the heavens like a curtain” (Psalms 104). Therefore the space of the Holy of Holies was by cubic measure."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:28.399688117Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}